  "body": "Greetings,\n\nART is very good.\nI am building a workflow of negative film processing, for museum.\nHere are some features needed:\n\nA panel of \"Favourite\". \nCombing some adjusting functions into one panel would help working effective.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/06173588-fd9b-4f91-994f-40b3009c5cd5)\n\nand,\nThe picker of negative film seems to be rigid, could you turn it into traditional one, the adjustable pixel size?\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/50df9989-e1d3-4988-a71d-8969d058a9bb)\n\nand,\nThere are few White Balance options. \nIs it possible to add some common option, like Tungsten, UnderWater and Daylight?\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d3aa18bb-f7e1-46e9-b0e9-69b09eb96f5f)\n\nThere's a bug of keyboard shortcuts, it's sensitive to Caps Lock!\nCould the keyboard shortcuts turn to be editable?\nPress \"l\" and \"l\"(L, Caps Lock), ART shows different window!\n\nThank you.\n\nART 1.25.1 on Windows 10 22H2.\n",
